OL,3,ADaniel Thomas admits boat criminal
OL,4,Adamage in channel
OL,5,
OL,6,FActivist Danny Tommo has admitted
OL,7,Fcriminal damage after slashing a
OL,8,Fmigrant dinghy with a knife in the
OL,9,FEnglish Channel.
OL,11,FThe 37-year-old, whose real name is
OL,12,FDaniel Thomas, changed his plea to the
OL,13,Fsingle charge when he appeared via
OL,14,Fvideo link from prison at Portsmouth
OL,15,FCrown Court on Thursday.
OL,17,FA court previously heard that he had
OL,18,Ftaken a boat into the English Channel
OL,19,Fand observed the migrant occupants of a
OL,20,Fdinghy being assisted by the RNLI,
OL,21,FBorder Force and the French Coastguard.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
